	class Item1
	{
		dataType="Comment";
		class PositionInfo {position[]={0,0,-5};};
		title="Moving radiation-emitter guided example. This vehicle carries a 20 m danger field using a named, hand-written profile rather than a preset. Move or replace the vehicle; the field follows it and is removed when the source is deleted. Audio and coughing are enabled, while the public marker is deliberately off. Edit the named profile values in its init or use the Minimal example for an empty harmless field. Wiki: https://github.com/AdamWaldie/WaldosMissionPack/wiki/Optional-Feature-Systems#hazardous-environments";
		id=2;
